am VI\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wDWwtvkRRlgTiUr6TyLSMX8FCuZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k6ANeyxAfMRi5xhxIXv1Scn9vc2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following the latest Ghostface killings, the four survivors leave Woodsboro behind and start a fresh chapter.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":263472,\"title\":\"Knock Knock\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cUC4rUb1Cs2KMaZ6RD4uYUEEwls.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9DclZBBDxMrbcqNS81Pjz8opZTW.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a devoted husband and father is left home alone for the weekend, two stranded young women unexpectedly knock on his door for help. What starts out as a kind gesture results in a dangerous seduction and a deadly game of cat and mouse.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1032823,\"title\":\"Trap\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jwoaKYVqPgYemFpaANL941EF94R.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dCgrFY6uTqhEpyhe8MzP1oExyLt.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A father and teen daughter attend a pop concert, where they realize they're at the center of a dark and sinister event.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":43947,\"title\":\"I Spit on Your Grave\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sD5mBllYcBR5sQTyR2VGYhpHf6B.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f4QIQvecRkKD5t7aPclyIr3SEP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A beautiful woman from the city, Jennifer Hills, rents an isolated cabin in the country to write her latest novel. Soon, a group of local lowlifes subject her to a nightmare of degradation, rape, and violence.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8643,\"title\":\"The Exorcism of Emily Rose\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qMN0HIP34f736kkQcfvTfmL9TP3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eHT36hVNslbJXCY3SXgtzxPE3cl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a young girl called Emily Rose dies, everyone puts blame on the exorcism which was performed on her by Father Moore prior to her death. The priest is arrested on suspicion of murder. The trial begins with lawyer Erin Bruner representing Moore, but it is not going to be easy, as no one wants to believe what Father Moore says is true.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1029281,\"title\":\"Strange Darling\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kWNCRgt3ocv19bYO0sk7TRuZuFY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/I4ofwq3XfmwXAETUs5pjubcMJ0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Nothing is what it seems when a twisted one-night stand spirals into a serial killer’s vicious murder spree.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":214,\"title\":\"Saw III\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4iO9n24Rb10peXV0JH2EldIOrAp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qx8Pb3nVnHLBizI9792pbRN5nnm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jigsaw has disappeared. Along with his new apprentice Amanda, the puppet-master behind the cruel, intricate games that have terrified a community and baffled police has once again eluded capture and vanished. While city detectives scramble to locate him, Doctor Lynn Denlon and Jeff Reinhart are unaware that they are about to become the latest pawns on his vicious chessboard.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":799379,\"title\":\"Project Wolf Hunting\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hmeIsFSClo5UBWxBiiCDCnDOYJY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mIW7eFxHnNqlwKwKWb6dpVjmHao.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While under heavily armed guard, the dangerous convicts aboard a cargo ship unite in a coordinated escape attempt that soon escalates into a bloody, all-out riot. But as the fugitives continue their brutal campaign of terror, they soon discover that not even the most vicious among them is safe from the horror they unknowingly unleashed from the darkness below deck.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18405,\"title\":\"The Last House on the Left\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Y35XCUS8U8vC8vs0HDEVkPu1BM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iiMR0RygNN3GTy8mjZOzXc5Q4jx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When athletic teen Mari Collingwood opts to hang out with her friend Paige in town rather than spend an evening in with her parents vacationing at the family's remote lake house, it marks the beginning of a night no one is going to forget.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":663,\"title\":\"Saw IV\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ku1QdCXOU4ckz3zxLLlis8MIJVm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3lrNJ5jNqKq9UpQrXo8FNFzyoE4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Despite Jigsaw's death, and in order to save the lives of two of his colleagues, Lieutenant Rigg is forced to take part in a new game, which promises to test him to the limit.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21467,\"title\":\"The Bone Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o17Qj2gT4HkU83kU6IlCH2k6jVU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jlEEzu7dXJPli4e8j1u2PW0VMf7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set in a sleepy Austrian mountain village, ex-detective Simon Brenner has grown weary of his job repossessing cars and embarks on an extended getaway to the countryside. But before long he becomes embroiled in the convoluted world of the locals of a supposedly quiet town.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"UG3h8EhHxb8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"beOCtzhH0U4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"s4nw9Q7ANjk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}